 "description": "SF-061 aws-iot-core-connection reference cases: the [aws_iot] connection settings, AWS IoT Core topic limits, IotCore bridge mapping rules, the AWS Device Shadow update patch and request/answer handling, and the policy-denied publication rule. Executed by the daemon (make edge-test) and modelled by scripts/greengrass_compat.py.",
